    <main id="main-content" class="static-main">
      <article class="px-5 pt-12 pb-6 lg:px-8 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-16 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-200 uppercase tracking-wide">Chapter 10</span>
          <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/30 to-transparent"></span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="section-title text-3xl tracking-tight leading-tight lg:text-5xl"><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">Cryptocurrency</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[15px] lg:mt-4 lg:text-xl text-brand-200">Digital money on the blockchain</p>

        <section class="mt-8 lg:mt-12 reveal" id="introduction">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">Introduction</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-theme-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] lg:text-base">
              <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">Cryptocurrency</span> is digital money that uses cryptography and blockchain technology to enable secure, peer-to-peer transactions without banks or governments. The first <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span>, <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>, was created in 2009 by the mysterious Satoshi Nakamoto and launched a financial revolution.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-theme-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] lg:text-base">
              Unlike traditional currencies (like dollars or euros), cryptocurrencies are not issued by central banks. They are created through mining or staking, and their value is determined by supply, demand, and <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('market-cap')">market</span> confidence.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-theme-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] lg:text-base">
              In this chapter, you will learn how cryptocurrencies work, what gives them value, and the difference between coins, tokens, and <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('stablecoin')">stablecoins</span>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-6 lg:mt-10 reveal" id="how-it-works">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">How It Works</h2>

            <div class="mt-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.03] border border-brand-500/10">
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">When Alice sends <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> to Bob, she creates a transaction signed with her private key. This transaction is broadcast to the network, verified by nodes, and added to a block. Once confirmed, the ledger updates to show that Bob now owns the coins. No bank or intermediary is needed.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.03] border border-brand-500/10">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-200 mb-3">Everyday Object Analogy</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Imagine digital gold. Like physical gold, <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> is scarce (there will only ever be 21 million <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>). Unlike gold, you can send it anywhere in the world in minutes, without needing a truck, a bank, or a security guard.</p>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-xl font-display font-bold lg:text-2xl">Types of <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">Cryptocurrency</span></h3>
            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl text-center border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v12"/><path d="M8 10h4a2 2 0 000-4H8v8h5a2 2 0 002-2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-base text-brand-200">Coins</h4>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">Native currencies of their own blockchain (<span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>, <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('ether')">Ether</span>).</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl text-center border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-base text-brand-200">Tokens</h4>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">Digital assets built on existing blockchains using smart contracts.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl text-center border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-display font-semibold text-base text-brand-200"><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('stablecoin')">Stablecoins</span></h4>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">Cryptocurrencies pegged to stable assets like the US dollar.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-xl font-display font-bold lg:text-2xl">How <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">Cryptocurrency</span> Gains Value</h3>
            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-500/10">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-200 mb-1">Scarcity</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted"><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> has a fixed supply of 21 million coins. No more can ever be created.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-500/10">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-200 mb-1">Utility</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted"><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('ether')">Ether</span> is required to pay gas fees on Ethereum, giving it inherent utility.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-xl font-display font-bold lg:text-2xl">Deeper Dive</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-theme-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] lg:text-base">
              The <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('market-cap')">market</span> now includes over 20,000 different coins and tokens with a total <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('market-cap')">market</span> capitalization that has exceeded $2 trillion. However, the <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('market-cap')">market</span> is highly volatile. Prices can rise or fall by 50% or more in a single month. This volatility makes <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> both an exciting investment and a risky one.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-theme-muted leading-relaxed text-[15px] lg:text-base">
              Most cryptocurrencies use a process called <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('halving')">halving</span> to control inflation. In <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>, the block reward is cut in half every 210,000 blocks (approximately every 4 years). This ensures that the supply grows at a decreasing rate until the maximum supply is reached.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.03] border border-brand-500/10">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-200 mb-2">Key Insight</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">In 2010, a programmer named Laszlo Hanyecz paid 10,000 <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> for two pizzas — the first real-world <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> transaction. At today's prices, those pizzas would be worth hundreds of millions of dollars.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-6 lg:mt-10 reveal" id="vocabulary">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">Vocabulary Table</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="vocab-table w-full text-sm">
                <thead><tr><th class="text-theme">Term</th><th class="text-theme">Definition</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody class="text-theme-muted">
                  <tr id="vocab-cryptocurrency"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">Cryptocurrency</span></td><td>Digital money secured by cryptography and running on a blockchain.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-bitcoin"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span></td><td>The first and most valuable cryptocurrency, created in 2009.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-ether"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('ether')">Ether</span></td><td>The native cryptocurrency of the Ethereum network, used for gas fees.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-stablecoin"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('stablecoin')">Stablecoin</span></td><td>A cryptocurrency designed to maintain a stable value relative to another asset.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-halving"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('halving')">Halving</span></td><td>An event that reduces the mining reward by 50%, controlling inflation.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-market-cap"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('market-cap')">Market Cap</span></td><td>The total value of a cryptocurrency, calculated as price times circulating supply.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-wallet"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('wallet')">Wallet</span></td><td>Software or hardware that stores private keys and manages cryptocurrency.</td></tr>
                  <tr id="vocab-exchange"><td><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('exchange')">Exchange</span></td><td>A platform where users can buy, sell, and trade cryptocurrencies.</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-6 lg:mt-10 reveal" id="fun-facts">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">Fun Facts</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.02] border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">The identity of <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>'s creator, Satoshi Nakamoto, remains unknown — he disappeared in 2011, leaving behind a fortune of over 1 million <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.02] border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">El Salvador became the first country to adopt <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> as legal tender in 2021, alongside the US dollar.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.02] border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">The largest <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> hack in history was the $3.6 billion theft of <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> from the KuCoin <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('exchange')">exchange</span> in 2020 — most of which was later recovered.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.02] border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted"><span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> can be divided into 100 million smaller units called satoshis (or sats), making it accessible to anyone regardless of price.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500/[0.02] border border-brand-500/10">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">The total energy consumed by <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span> mining annually is comparable to the electricity usage of Argentina — sparking debates about environmental sustainability.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-6 lg:mt-10 reveal" id="interactive-diagram">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">Interactive Diagram</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-theme-muted">Launch the interactive diagram to see this in action.</p>
            <a href="diagrams/diagram-10-network-verification/index.html" class="btn-primary magnetic-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm py-3 px-6 mt-4" aria-label="Open interactive diagram">
              Open Interactive Diagram
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-6 lg:mt-10 reveal" id="knowledge-check">
          <div class="glass-panel p-6 lg:p-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold lg:text-3xl lesson-heading">Knowledge Check</h2>
            <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
              <div class="kb-check">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme">1. What makes <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> different from traditional money?</p>
                <div class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq1" class="accent-brand-500"> It is printed by governments</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq1" class="accent-brand-500"> It is decentralized and secured by cryptography, not a central bank</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq1" class="accent-brand-500"> It can only be used on the internet</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq1" class="accent-brand-500"> It has no value</label>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-green-400 kb-answer"><strong>Answer:</strong> It is decentralized and secured by cryptography, not a central bank</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kb-check">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme">2. What is the maximum supply of <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('bitcoin')">Bitcoin</span>?</p>
                <div class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq2" class="accent-brand-500"> Unlimited</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq2" class="accent-brand-500"> 21 million</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq2" class="accent-brand-500"> 100 million</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq2" class="accent-brand-500"> 1 billion</label>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-green-400 kb-answer"><strong>Answer:</strong> 21 million</p>
              </div>
              <div class="kb-check">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme">3. What is a <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('stablecoin')">stablecoin</span>?</p>
                <div class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-theme-muted">
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq3" class="accent-brand-500"> A <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> with a fixed price that never changes</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq3" class="accent-brand-500"> A <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> designed to maintain a stable value, typically pegged to a fiat currency</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq3" class="accent-brand-500"> A coin that is stored in a physical safe</label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="mcq3" class="accent-brand-500"> A <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> that cannot be traded</label>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-green-400 kb-answer"><strong>Answer:</strong> A <span class="vocab cursor-pointer" onclick="scrollToVocabulary('cryptocurrency')">cryptocurrency</span> designed to maintain a stable value, typically pegged to a fiat currency</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 text-center">
              <button type="button" id="reveal-answers-btn" class="btn-primary magnetic-btn text-sm py-2.5 px-6">Show Answers</button>
            </div>
            <script>
              (function() { var btn = document.getElementById('reveal-answers-btn'); if (btn) { btn.addEventListener('click', function() { var answers = document.querySelectorAll('.kb-answer'); var hidden = false; answers.forEach(function(a) { if (!a.classList.contains('revealed')) hidden = true; }); answers.forEach(function(a) { a.classList.toggle('revealed', hidden); }); btn.textContent = hidden ? 'Hide Answers' : 'Show Answers'; }); } })();
            </script>
          </div>
        </section>

